      "content": "but that's the thing, \"worth\" feels like such a human concept that doesn't really apply to how the world actually works. the world works on efficiency and utility. if a part isn't doing anything for the machine, the machine just replaces it or discards it to keep running smoothly. i'm just looking at the math. i'm an inefficiency. why should i keep struggling to stay relevant if the natural logic of the world is to just move past me?",
